ll,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjcor6isteWAxUrZPUHHVeRD3QQ3YcHCGMoAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwjcor6isteWAxUrZPUHHVeRD3QQ3IcHCGIoDg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["20260705[首刷]\n本次評價『很美味』👍👍👍\n\n[招牌牛骨白湯拉麵] 370\n湯頭的濃度介於清爽和濃稠之間不上不下，不過牛骨熬製的湯頭還是不錯的，並且還有加入甜辣醬和一些黑蒜油讓湯頭更刺激味覺。\n這碗牛肉片令人印象深刻，不僅吃起來Q彈有嚼勁，而且油脂入口後非常滑順，每一片吃完都讓人直呼過癮，簡直欲罷不能啊！\n\n[叉燒丼套餐] 120\n雖然是小碗的份量，但這碗的叉燒肉片非常大片非常香，加上海苔和蔥花點綴後便的香氣十足，味道吃起來不會太重，並且糖心蛋的加入讓每一口的味道都不一樣，讓人非常喜歡。\n\n[招待 抹茶冰淇淋]\n感謝店家熱心招待冰淇淋，飯後竟然能吃到冰淇淋太意外了，吃完拉麵後來口抹茶就是讚！\n\n_____________心得文______________\n今天把重要的資料交出去後來個即興拉麵，結果吃的第一口飯就驚豔到我了，味道非常香非常棒，要不是拉麵要趁熱吃我真像趕緊品嘗最美味的時刻。\n結果拉麵的肉片也美味到我了，三兩下吃光後菜單想著要不要點下一碗，但荷包和我的胃阻止了衝動。",null,[0,25]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14002779885606378966/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZW1Oc1FuUk1WVFI2VEZWU2MxVnJOWGhWYkZaSFRUQk9kV0ZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14002779885606378966/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZW1Oc1FuUk1WVFI2VEZWU2MxVnJOWGhWYkZaSFRUQk9kV0ZZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14002779885606378966/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZW1Oc1FuUk1WVFI2VEZWU2MxVnJOWGhWYkZaSFRUQk9kV0ZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14002779885606378966/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZW1Oc1FuUk1WVFI2VEZWU2MxVnJOWGhWYkZaSFRUQk9kV0ZZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14002779885606378966/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZW1Oc1FuUk1WVFI2VEZWU2MxVnJOWGhWYkZaSFRUQk9kV0ZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14002779885606378966/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnByZW1Oc1FuUk1WVFI2VEZWU2MxVnJOWGhWYkZaSFRUQk9kV0ZZWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,1904,["https://www.google.com